This repository redistributes:

- proto/org/apache/tika/grpc/v2/document.proto and tika_v2.proto, copied unchanged from
  commit 26488ed83ddd575f457b85ecea0b13fccb307288 of
  https://github.com/ai-pipestream/tika (a fork of Apache Tika, Apache License 2.0), and the
  Java classes under src/main/java/org/apache/tika/grpc/v2 generated from them;
- testserver/docs/testPDF.pdf, testPDF_childAttachments.pdf and testPDF_protected.pdf, as
  found in Apache Tika's test corpus (tika-parser-pdf-module/src/test/resources/test-documents).
  Their own terms apply: testPDF_childAttachments.pdf is IRS Publication 15 (a US government
  work) and testPDF_protected.pdf is a Bank of England speech that reached Tika through
  PDFBOX-858;
- proto/google/protobuf/timestamp.proto, from Protocol Buffers (BSD-3-Clause).

